    "One run, on one provider, one node, one Kubernetes version, one release, one model, and one caller workload. A result is bounded to that execution.",
    "V2-E02A is a baseline characterization. Its criteria are validity criteria alone, so the state PASSED states that the run is valid. It does not state that the service stayed available.",
